"VOUS TIREZ"
Lbl B
Int 52Ran#+1->Y
List 1[Y]=0=>Goto B
A+List 1[Y]->A
List 1[Y]
0->List 1[Y]
"SCORE":A
If A=21:Then ClrText
"--BLACKJACK--"
